stream
BT /F1 9 Tf 11 TL 54 740 Td
(# 28 Register map summary) '
() '
(Table 28-1. Register map.) '
() '
(  Addr   Name       Access   Default   Description                        Page) '
(  0x00   CHIP_ID    R        0x14      Device identifier                  29) '
(  0x01   REV        R        0xA1/A2   Silicon revision                   29) '
(  0x02   CONF1      RW/OTP   0x00      Power mode, ADC options            29) '
(  0x03   ZPOS_H     RW/OTP   0x00      Zero position, bits 13..8          30) '
(  0x04   ZPOS_L     RW/OTP   0x00      Zero position, bits 7..0           30) '
(  0x05   MPOS_H     RW/OTP   0x3F      Maximum position, bits 13..8       30) '
(  0x06   MPOS_L     RW/OTP   0xFF      Maximum position, bits 7..0        30) '
(  0x07   -          -        -         Reserved, do not write             -) '
(  0x08   CONF2      RW       0x00      FILT, DIR, HYST, WD \(volatile\)     31, 32) '
(  0x09   -          -        -         Reserved, do not write             -) '
(  0x0A   -          -        -         Reserved, do not write             -) '
(  0x0B   STATUS     RC       0x01      RST, MAGL, MAGH, MD, OVF           33) '
(  0x0C   ANGLE_H    R        -         Scaled angle, bits 13..8           34) '
(  0x0D   ANGLE_L    R        -         Scaled angle, bits 7..0            34) '
(  0x0E   RAW_H      R        -         Raw angle, bits 13..8              34) '
(  0x0F   RAW_L      R        -         Raw angle, bits 7..0               34) '
(  0x10   -          -        -         Reserved \(see errata E-4\)          59) '
(  0x1A   AGC        R        -         Automatic gain control value       35) '
(  0x1B   MAG_H      R        -         Field magnitude, bits 11..8        35) '
(  0x1C   MAG_L      R        -         Field magnitude, bits 7..0         35) '
(  0x30   CMD        W        -         Soft reset, OTP burn               36) '
() '
(## 28.1 Volatile and non-volatile registers) '
() '
(CONF1, ZPOS and MPOS have OTP shadows: after a reset they are reloaded from) '
(OTP. CONF2 has no OTP shadow and returns to 0x00 after every reset. STATUS) '
(returns to 0x01 \(RST set\) after every reset.) '
() '
(## 28.2 Reserved addresses) '
() '
(Writes to reserved addresses are ignored. Reads return 0x00, except 0x10) '
(\(errata E-4, page 59\).) '
ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 200.25 36 Td (ENCX14-RM rev 1.2    CC-BY-4.0    page 28 of 60) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
